For $E_1$, cases $(x,y)=00,10,01,11$ give respectively

$$
\begin{aligned}
43+89(z+q)-46zq+3v(1-z-q-h)&\le175,\\
166+46(z+q)-46zq+3v(1-z-q-h)&\le212,\\
